s="tp">1899–1986</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/fernand-braudel"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/fernand-braudel.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Fernand Braudel</span><span class="tp">1902–1985</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/sauli-niinisto"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Sauli Niinistö</span><span class="tp">b. 1948</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
